1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:01,774
Maya, look!

2
00:00:01,774 --> 00:00:03,666
I found a second Taj Mahal.

3
00:00:04,178 --> 00:00:06,104
A second one? Where are you looking?

4
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:08,221
Down here, in the water.

5
00:00:08,221 --> 00:00:10,134
Even the dome is upside down.

6
00:00:10,825 --> 00:00:12,436
Oh, I see it! Hold still.

7
00:00:12,436 --> 00:00:14,053
I want a picture of both.

8
00:00:14,722 --> 00:00:16,434
Both? Hey, what about me?

9
00:00:17,249 --> 00:00:19,090
Fine. All three. Smile!
